   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Enterprise Agency</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High end engineering and manufacturing technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Bosnia, the metal industry is an important economic sector. There are several wholesalers of metal and metal processing companies. Bosnia has vocational schools and universities with education of technicians and engineers for this sector. Currently, production companies mainly construct objects which are designed by other (Western) companies.In this project partners set up a factory for an integrated engineering and production facility in which partners will produce trailers and loading systems for trailers through an advanced high end production method of modular engineering. This model enables the partners to design different modules within the company which can be combined for the specific needs of clients.The project will be realised by two partners in a newly set up joint venture company. Applicant is Groep Jumbo Groenewegen B.V., which currently produces high end custom-made trailers in the Netherlands and standard chassis for trailers in Bosnia, within their Bosnian daughter company BME. Local partner is Euro Metali d.o.o., a Bosnian wholesale company in metal products and semi-finished ferrous and non-ferrous metallurgy. Partners intend to set up a joint venture.</narrative>
  </description>
